7592186045487 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371678 1071 "Let $P={{z}_{0},{z}_{1},…,{z}_{q}}$ be a partition of the interval $[1,5].$ If $Δ{z}_{k}={z}_{k}-{z}_{k-1},$ calculate ${\\sum }_{k=1}^{q}3Δ{z}_{k}.$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371678 1072 #uuid "8e30bca8-aff5-5d14-a0a6-d488fdbb7f44" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371678 1074 "First, we take the factor $3$ outside the summation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{k=1}^{q}3Δ{z}_{k}=3{\\sum }_{k=1}^{q}Δ{z}_{k}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that ${\\sum }_{k=1}^{q}Δ{z}_{k}$ is just the length of the interval $[1,5],$ because\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{k=1}^{q}Δ{z}_{k} & =({z}_{1}-{z}_{0})+({z}_{2}-{z}_{1})+({z}_{3}-{z}_{2})+⋯+({z}_{q}-{z}_{q-1}) \\\\  & =(\\cancel{{z}_{1}}-{z}_{0})+(\\cancel{{z}_{2}}-\\cancel{{z}_{1}})+(\\cancel{{z}_{3}}-\\cancel{{z}_{2}})+⋯+({z}_{q}-\\cancel{{z}_{q-1}}) \\\\  & =-{z}_{0}+{z}_{q} \\\\  & ={z}_{q}-{z}_{0} \\\\  & =5-1 \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n3{\\sum }_{k=1}^{q}Δ{z}_{k}=3\\cdot 4=12.\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371679 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371680 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371679 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371681 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371679 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371682 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371679 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371683 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371679 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371684 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371679 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371679 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371679 1079 #edb/ref 17592186371680 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371679 1080 #uuid "c067dbbf-c66c-5ade-9705-9719658993d8" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371680 1081 "12" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371680 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371680 1084 #uuid "0f62f437-a523-5d42-b216-6503e704d9f2" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371681 1081 "9" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371681 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371681 1084 #uuid "297868db-02c3-5982-baf7-27a0d51ea4bc" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371682 1081 "3" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371682 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371682 1084 #uuid "f18a6c3b-cdb8-5aee-b0cf-127aac5e992f" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371683 1081 "15" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371683 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371683 1084 #uuid "c55b5cfd-9a50-5b9e-973a-b48e32e7997e" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371684 1081 "6" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371684 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371684 1084 #uuid "518f29fb-37d7-581e-b6a6-f4c09c10f89f" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371685 1068 #edb/ref 17592186371686 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371685 1069 "q-123853" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371685 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371685 1071 "Let $R=[5,6]\\times [1,3]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)$ be a function defined over $R.$\nThe lower and upper Riemann sums corresponding to an arbitrary partition $P$ of $R$ are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(2{x}_{i-1}-3{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}, \\\\ U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(2{x}_{i}-3{y}_{j-1})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the definition of the double integral in terms of $L(f,P)$ and $U(f,P),$ compute ${∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.$\n\n*Hint: You may wish to make use of the following result:*\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}=({x}_{m}^{2}-{x}_{0}^{2})({y}_{n}-{y}_{0})\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371685 1072 #uuid "eeafd037-077a-51ed-84eb-4b9e62434000" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371685 1074 "For a function $f(x,y),$ the double integral of $f$ over a rectangular region $R$ is the unique number $I$ (if it exists) such that\n\n$$\nL(f,P)\\le I\\le U(f,P)\n$$\n\nover all partitions $P$ of $R.$\n\nFirst, notice that ${\\overset{¯}{x}}_{i}=\\frac{1}{2}({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})$ will always lie between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$, and similarly ${\\overset{¯}{y}}_{j}=\\frac{1}{2}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})$ will always lie between ${y}_{j-1}$ and ${y}_{j}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n2{x}_{i-1}-3{y}_{j}\\le 2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})-3\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})\\le 2{x}_{i}-3{y}_{j-1}\n$$\n\nwhich simplifies to\n\n$$\n2{x}_{i-1}-3{y}_{j}\\le ({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})-\\frac{3}{2}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})\\le 2{x}_{i}-3{y}_{j-1}.\n$$\n\nMultiplying this by $Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}$ and applying the double summation gives:\n\n$$\nL(f,P)\\le {\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}[({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})-\\frac{3}{2}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})]Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\le U(f,P)\n$$\n\nSeparating the sums using the addition and constant multiple rules, we get\n\n$$\nL(f,P)\\le {\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}-\\frac{3}{2}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\le U(f,P).\n$$\n\nUsing the hint, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} & =({6}^{2}-{5}^{2})(3-1)=22 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} & =\\frac{3}{2}({3}^{2}-{1}^{2})(6-5)=12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally then:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P)\\le 22-12\\le U(f,P)\\,⟹\\,L(f,P)\\le 10\\le U(f,P)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that \n\n$$\n{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A=10.\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 tru