x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}$ and applying the double summation gives:\n\n$$\nL(f,P)\\le {\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}[({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})-2({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})-3]Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\le U(f,P)\n$$\n\nSeparating the sums using the addition rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & \\le {\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} \\\\  & \\,-2{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} \\\\  & \\,-3{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} \\\\  & \\le U(f,P).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the hint, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({x}_{j-1}+{x}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} & =2({3}^{2}-{1}^{2})(10-8)=32 \\\\ {\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} & =({10}^{2}-{8}^{2})(3-1)=72 \\\\ 3{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} & =3(3-1)(10-8)=12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally then:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P)\\le 72-32-12\\le U(f,P)\\,⟹\\,L(f,P)\\le 28\\le U(f,P)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that \n\n$$\n{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A=28.\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371693 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371694 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371693 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371695 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371693 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371696 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371693 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371697 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371693 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371698 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371693 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371693 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371693 1079 #edb/ref 17592186371695 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371693 1080 #uuid "95fe2b2e-67f2-5891-9148-f7417c19e420" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371694 1081 "60" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371694 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 131941395334