ng the rules for single summations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}3{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}(4-{b}_{j}) & =(3{\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}{a}_{i})\\cdot ({\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}4-{\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}{b}_{j}) \\\\  & =(3{\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}{a}_{i})\\cdot (4{\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}1-{\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}{b}_{j}) \\\\  & =(3\\cdot 30)\\cdot (4\\cdot 12-45) \\\\  & =(90)\\cdot (48-45) \\\\  & =(90)\\cdot (3) \\\\  & =270\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371872 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371873 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371872 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371874 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371872 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371875 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371872 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371876 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371872 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371877 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371872 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371872 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371872 1079 #edb/ref 17592186371874 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371872 1080 #uuid "9a9613f8-bb30-5421-9518-35d93e8b06bc" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371873 1081 "290" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371873 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371873 1084 #uuid "f2b739c5-c8b2-5d66-bd15-ef2f8e39e22f" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371874 1081 "270" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371874 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371874 1084 #uuid "1ac2df96-9c6b-5f86-8982-4c6f89455e73" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371875 1081 "330" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371875 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371875 1084 #uuid "b8ae4afc-a713-5930-a923-062a26b12166" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371876 1081 "310" 13194139533450 175921