bles gives us the *inverse* function ${T}^{-1},$ that is\n\n$$\n{T}^{-1}:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\\to [\\begin{aligned}u(x,y) \\\\ v(x,y)\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n**Step 2**: Find $Δ,$ which is the image of $D$ under the action of ${T}^{-1}.$ \n\nWe substitute $u={x}^{2}y$ into the equations of the first and second curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {x}^{2}y=2\\,⟹\\,u=2 \\\\  & {x}^{2}y=4\\,⟹\\,u=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAnd we substitute $v=xy$ into the equations of the third and fourth curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & xy=1\\,⟹\\,v=1 \\\\  & xy=3\\,⟹\\,v=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our domain in the $uv$-plane is the following rectangle:\n\n$$\nΔ={(u,v)\\,:\\,2\\le u\\le 4,\\,1\\le v\\le 3}\n$$\n\n![](images/ba/baa8e8ab6cff8edec84d3f0d0950931f247153523e3320abbdf673161afb44ae.png)\n\n**Step 3**: Compute the Jacobian determinant corresponding to ${T}^{-1}:$\n\nThe Jacobian determinant corresponding to ${T}^{-1}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(u,v)}{∂(x,y)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂u}{∂x} & \\frac{∂u}{∂y} \\\\ \\frac{∂v}{∂x} & \\frac{∂v}{∂y}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2xy & {x}^{2} \\\\ y & x\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2{x}^{2}y-{x}^{2}y \\\\  & =u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 4**: Compute the Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T:$\n\nThe Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}={(\\frac{∂(u,v)}{∂(x,y)})}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{u}.\n$$\n\nNote that $\\frac{∂(u,v)}{∂(x,y)}\\ne 0$ everywhere inside $Δ.$  In other words, $T$ has no critical points inside $Δ.$\n\n**Step 5**: Compute the required area.\n\nWe calculate the required area by performing the change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}\\text{d}x\\text{d}y & ={∬}_{Δ}|\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}|\\,\\text{d}u\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={∬}_{Δ}|\\frac{1}{u}|\\,\\text{d}u\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={∬}_{Δ}\\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={\\int }_{2}^{4}\\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u{\\int }_{1}^{3}\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & =(\\operatorname{ln}⁡4-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)\\cdot (3-1) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371879 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371880 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371879 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371881 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371879 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371882 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371879 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371883 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371879 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371884 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371879 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371879 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371879 1079 #edb/ref 17592186371882 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371879 1080 #uuid "6938f289-182f-5501-8657-403464e01c47" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371880 1081 "-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371880 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371880 1084 #uuid "db65b2cf-8271-5607-a640-ae769caddf03" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371881 1081 "-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371881 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371881 1084 #uuid "23bd3ecb-441d-5a27-8b9f-49934c6dbae7" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371882 1081 "2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371882 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371882 1084 #uuid "934e91be-6058-5dc5-ba33-86ee65e0a431" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371883 1081 "3\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371883 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371883 1084 #uuid "3e8bd3b1-0508-595d-9241-fa8262df8825" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186371884 1081 "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592