or field with simply connected domain $D={R}^{2},$ where $P(x,y)=3({x}^{2}-{y}^{2})$ and $Q(x,y)=-6xy.$ Computing the partial derivatives, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂x}=6x,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} & =-6x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, $F$ has a stream function, since\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}=6x+(-6x)=0.\n$$\n\nNext, we find a stream function. A function $ψ(x,y)$ is a stream function of the vector field $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$ if \n\n$$\nP=\\frac{∂ψ}{∂y},\\,Q=-\\frac{∂ψ}{∂x}.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂ψ}{∂y}=3({x}^{2}-{y}^{2}),\\,\\frac{∂ψ}{∂x}=6xy.\n$$\n\nIntegrating these equations, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\nψ(x,y)=3{x}^{2}y-{y}^{3}+f(x),\\,ψ(x,y)=3{x}^{2}y+g(y)\n$$\n\nwhere $f$ and $g$ are arbitrary functions. Finally, setting $f=0,$ and $g(y)=-{y}^{3},$ we have\n\n$$\nψ(x,y)=3{x}^{2}y-{y}^{3}.\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372076 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372077 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372076 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372078 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372076 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372079 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372076 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372080 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372076 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372081 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372076 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372076 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372076 1079 #edb/ref 17592186372078 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372076 1080 #uuid "0298ba8f-3875-5cfc-99ba-d4ad417d980d" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372077 1081 "ψ(x,y)=2x{y}^{3}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372077 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372077 1084 #uuid "bdb66e66-97ce-510e-91ff-36e680214001" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372078 1081 "ψ(x,y)=3{x}^{2}y-{y}^{3}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372078 1083 #edb/ref 175921