194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372159 1072 #uuid "9f67f3f6-b8ed-585a-bae8-a685dca4c830" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372159 1074 "A vector field $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$ with a simply connected domain $D⊆{R}^{2}$ has a stream function $ψ(x,y)$ if and only if\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}=0.\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's consider each vector field.\n\n- Vector field I doesn't have a stream function. The partial derivatives are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂x}=3,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} & =-2y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}=3+(-2y)\\ne 0.\n$$\n\n- Vector field II doesn't have a stream function. The partial derivatives are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂x}=1,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} & =2xy.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}=1+2xy\\ne 0.\n$$\n\n- Vector field III has a stream function. Indeed, the partial derivatives are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂x}=2x,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} & =-2x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}=2x+(-2x)=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372161 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372162 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372163 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372164 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372165 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372160 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372160 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372160 1079 #edb/ref 17592186372163 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372160 1080 #uuid "6819a21c-99be-5e9c-8731-b133fa4015f6" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372161 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533450 17592186045585 t