ind, let's consider each vector field.\n\n- Vector field I doesn't have a stream function. The partial derivatives are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂x}=4{y}^{2},\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} & =-2xy.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}=4{y}^{2}+(-2xy)\\ne 0.\n$$\n\n- Vector field II has a stream function. Indeed, the partial derivatives are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂x}={e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} & =-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}={e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y+(-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y)=0.\n$$\n\n- Vector field III has a stream function. Indeed, the partial derivatives are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂x}=2y,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} & =-2y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}=2y+(-2y)=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372168 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372169 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372170 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372171 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372172 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372167 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372167 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372167 1079 #edb/ref 17592186372169 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372167 1080 #uuid "93f6beb4-8a8c-502c-89e9-993e548efd10" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372168 1081 "I, II, and III" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372168 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372168 1084 #uuid "8e556591-bf8e-53a8-acf1-d74a29633dd5" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372169 1081 "II a