1069 "q-163655" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372250 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372250 1071 "A rectangular plate of mass $M$ occupies the region\n$D={(x,y)\\,:\\,-1\\le x\\le 1,\\,\\,1\\le y\\le 2}.$\nThe mass density at each point is proportional to its $y$-coordinate. Find the moment of inertia of the plate about the line $x=1.$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372250 1072 #uuid "eead8607-f417-5d93-8476-ee8ee91792a7" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372250 1074 "The moment of inertia of a plane lamina in the shape of a region $D$ about an axis of rotation $l$ is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{l}={∬}_{D}\\lambda (x,y)[r(x,y)]^{2}\\,\\text{d}A,\n$$\n\nwhere $\\lambda (x,y)$ is the mass density function of the lamina, and $r(x,y)$ is the distance from the line $l$ to the point $(x,y)$ on $D.$\n\nFirst, the distance between a point and the line $x=1$ is given by\n\n$$\nr(x,y)=|x-1|.\n$$\n\nNext, the mass density can be written as $\\lambda (x,y)=ky,$ where $k$ is a constant of proportionality. We can find the value of $k$ by integrating the mass density function over the plate.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{1}^{2}ky\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =k({\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\,\\text{d}x)({\\int }_{1}^{2}y\\,\\text{d}y) \\\\  & =k\\cdot {[x]}_{-1}^{1}\\cdot {[\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}]}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =k(1-(-1))(2-\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =3k.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, \n\n$$\n\\lambda (x,y)=ky=\\frac{M}{3}y.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the moment of inertia about the line $x=1$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{l} & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (x,y)[r(x,y)]^{2}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{M}{3}y|x-1{|}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{M}{3}y(x-1)^{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{3}({\\int }_{-1}^{1}(x-1)^{2}\\,\\text{d}x)({\\int }_{1}^{2}y\\,\\text{d}y) \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{3}\\cdot {[\\frac{1}{3}(x-1)^{3}]}_{-1}^{1}\\cdot {[\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}]}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}(0-(-8))\\cdot [\\frac{1}{2}(4-1)] \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{3}\\cdot \\frac{8}{3}\\cdot \\frac{3}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{4M}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372251 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372252 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372251 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372253 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372251 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372254 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372251 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372255 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372251 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372256 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372251 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372251 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372251 1079 #edb/ref 17592186372255 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372251 1080 #uuid "bd8a8cb6-0e83-5420-93a5-5920703ecb73" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372252 1081 "\\frac{16M}{5}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372252 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372252 1084 #uuid "f3f2366a-da38-5098-a9b0-d9dfd00c28e6" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372253 1081 "\\frac{2M}{9}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372253 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372253 1084 #uuid "5724d7c2-aad7-5481-9158-676c52282dd8" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372254 1081 "\\frac{4M}{9}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372254 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372254 1084 #uuid "bf51920e-8022-5e4f-b8b2-966cd5b3aaa1" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372255 1081 "\\frac{4M}{3}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372255 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372255 1084 #uuid "fe75a8a2