264 1071 "A circular plate of mass $3\\,\\text{kg}$ with uniform mass density occupies the region of a disk $D$ of radius $2\\,\\text{m}$ and is centered at the origin.\nGiven that the moment of inertia of the plate about a line $l$ perpendicular to the plate is $15\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2},$ find the distance of the line $l$ from the center of mass of $D.$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372264 1072 #uuid "5b1269dc-9a9c-5e0c-a19a-b98eb7ba6d4e" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372264 1074 "For a plane lamina of mass $M$ and a line ${l}_{M}$ perpendicular to the lamina passing through its center of mass, the parallel axis theorem states that the moment of inertia of the lamina about a line $l$ parallel to ${l}_{M}$ is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{l}={I}_{M}+{d}^{2}M,\n$$\n\nwhere $d$ is the distance between the lines, and ${I}_{M}$ and ${I}_{l}$ are the moments of inertia about the lines ${l}_{M}$ and $l,$ respectively.\n\nFirst, notice that the region $D$ can be expressed in polar coordinates as\n\n$$\nD={(r,\\theta )\\,:\\,0\\le r\\le 2,\\,0\\le \\theta <2\\pi }.\n$$\n\nThe area of the circular plate $D$ is $A=\\pi \\cdot {2}^{2}=4\\pi \\,{\\text{m}}^{2}.$\nSince the plate has a uniform density, the mass density function is given by\n\n$$\n\\lambda (r,\\theta )=\\frac{M}{A}=\\frac{3}{4\\pi }\\,\\text{kg}/{\\text{m}}^{2},\n$$\n\nand its center of mass is its centroid $(0,0).$\n\nThen, the moment of inertia about the perpendicular line through the center of mass is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{M} & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{2}{r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}{r}^{4}\\,{|}_{0}^{2}\\cdot \\theta \\,{|}_{0}^{2\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4\\pi }\\cdot 4\\cdot 2\\pi  \\\\  & =6\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, applying the parallel axis theorem and solving for $d,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & ={I}_{M}+{d}^{2}M \\\\ 15 & =6+3{d}^{2} \\\\ 3{d}^{2} & =9 \\\\ {d}^{2} & =3 \\\\ d & =\\sqrt{3}\\,\\text{m}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372265 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372266 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372265 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372267 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372265 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372268 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372265 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372269 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372265 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372270 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372265 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372265 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372265 1079 #edb/ref 17592186372268 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372265 1080 #uuid "04b0fc00-ef8c-5056-81e5-49ba0ee0196f" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372266 1081 "\\sqrt{6}\\,\\text{m}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372266 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372266 1084 #uuid "0628d5fa-0c84-54d1-887b-e712493fab1b" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372267 1081 "6\\,\\text{m}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372267 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372267 1084 #uuid "a4c08e77-103b-5c80-9f62-abcfdc6be030" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372268 1081 "\\sqrt{3}\\,\\text{m}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372268 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372268 1084 #uuid "5cc167dd-0b7b-5d24-a2ce-95b75fbbbb74" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372269 1081 "3\\,\\text{m}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372269 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372269 1084 #uuid "1f4f95f7-759a-5c50-913b-4e29440fde27" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186