592186372487 1068 #edb/ref 17592186372490 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372487 1069 "q-277806" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372487 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372487 1071 "In **ascending order,** the $x$-coordinates of the points where the hyperbola $2{y}^{2}-25{x}^{2}=625$ intersects the line $y=-5x$ are\n\n$\\,x=$\n{{field-1}}$\\,$ and $\\,x=$\n{{field-2}}." 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372487 1072 #uuid "40ee8abc-a370-5f9e-aca7-98eb85a4280e" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372487 1074 "To find the points where the hyperbola intersects the line $y=-5x,$ we first replace $y$ with $-5x$ in the equation of the hyperbola and solve for $x,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{y}^{2}-25{x}^{2} & =625 \\\\ 2(-5x)^{2}-25{x}^{2} & =625 \\\\ 2(25{x}^{2})-25{x}^{2} & =625 \\\\ 50{x}^{2}-25{x}^{2} & =625 \\\\ 25{x}^{2} & =625 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =25 \\\\ x & =\\pm 5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, in ascending order, the $x$-coordinates of the points of intersection are\n$x=-5$ and $x=5.$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372488 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372489 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372488 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372488 1077 "field-1" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372488 1079 #edb/ref 17592186372489 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372488 1080 #uuid "af462b30-53a5-5a99-9bb3-7dbaed8a8b52" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372489 1081 "-5" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372489 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372489 1084 #uuid "98c863f7-b438-5664-a947-3dcaceb9a809" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372490 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372491 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372490 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372490 1077 "field-2" 13194139533450 175921860