 $4{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-8x-4y+4=0$ intercepts the $y$-axis.\n\nThe $y$-intercept is $($\n{{field-1}}\n,\n{{field-2}}$).$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372602 1072 #uuid "8545c63e-d5d7-58d5-bf63-69929a149c41" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372602 1074 "To calculate the $y$-intercept, we need to substitute $x=0$ in the equation of the ellipse and try to solve the resulting equation for $y.$ We do this and solve the resulting equation by completing the square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-8x-4y+4 & =0 \\\\ 4(0)^{2}+{y}^{2}-8(0)-4y+4 & =0 \\\\ {y}^{2}-4y+4 & =0 \\\\ (y-2)^{2} & =0 \\\\ y-2 & =0 \\\\ y & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the ellipse intercepts the $y$-axis at the point $(0,2).$\n\n![](images/d2/d2e5f3fc609249eda5a995005e462f3ba1b36a97fd5027de480b9f04c9705fb0.png)" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372603 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372604 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372603 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372603 1077 "field-1" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372603 1079 #edb/ref 17592186372604 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372603 1080 #uuid "c1e38106-6768-5d9b-b2d9-3c7230a82374" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372604 1081 "0" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372604 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372604 1084 #uuid "4d6b5692-0714-5900-a403-8962414cef92" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372605 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372606 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372605 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372605 1077 "field-2" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372605 1079 #edb/ref 17592186372606 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372605 1080 #uuid "1b22426f-184c-5f6a-9fa4-8e2882583661" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186372606 1081 "2" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [1759218637