373089 1071 "Compute the sum of the first $8$ terms of the geometric series $3+6+12+24+⋯$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373089 1072 #uuid "b0daf23f-3a33-5581-985b-cf42852a53a8" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373089 1074 "Given a geometric series, the sum of the first $N$ terms is given by the formula\n\n$$\n{S}_{N}={a}_{1}\\frac{(1-{r}^{N})}{1-r},\n$$\n\nwhere ${a}_{1}$ is the first term of the series and $r$ is the common ratio.\n\nIn our case, ${a}_{1}=3.$ To find the value of $r,$ we find the ratio of the first two terms in the series:\n\n$$\nr=\\frac{{a}_{2}}{{a}_{1}}=\\frac{6}{3}=2\n$$\n\nIf we substitute ${a}_{1}=3,N=8$ and $r=2$ into our formula, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{S}_{8} & =3\\cdot \\frac{1-{2}^{8}}{1-2} \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{1-{2}^{8}}{-1} \\\\  & =(-3)(-255) \\\\  & =765\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373090 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373091 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373090 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373092 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373090 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373093 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373090 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373094 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373090 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373095 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373090 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373090 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373090 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373095 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373090 1080 #uuid "e1cfe520-b06d-5e87-9e55-120e6a20d491" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373091 1081 "909" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373091 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373091 1084 #uuid "aedf4ccc-b150-513c-883f-1efcfa753cc5" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373092 1081 "1\\,002" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373092 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 131941395