8}(1-{7}^{10})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, comparing the above with $k(1-{7}^{10}),$ we obtain $k=-\\frac{1}{8}.$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373097 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373098 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373097 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373099 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373097 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373100 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373097 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373101 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373097 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373102 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373097 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373097 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373097 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373101 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373097 1080 #uuid "5076d252-0853-5303-95a2-fd64de505bb3" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373098 1081 "-8" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373098 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373098 1084 #uuid "6b5009cb-b05d-54c7-bfb4-d00dbe482c73" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373099 1081 "-\\frac{1}{6}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373099 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373099 1084 #uuid "d48c059a-7aef-556e-b043-4bee6ac59e2c" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373100 1081 "7" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373100 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373100 1084 #uuid "36a3f166-4da0-51b8-b155-db5944f40b2e" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373101 1081 "-\\frac{1}{8}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373101 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373101 1084 #uuid "baa8459e-7c08-5d32-8337-86e180b182f3" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373102 1081 "\\frac{1}{7}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373102 1083 #edb/ref 1759218604