ives, we have\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(\\theta )=-{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ,\\,{y}^{′}(\\theta )=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{0}{-{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta }=0.\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting into our formula for the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\frac{d}{d\\theta }(0)}{-{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{0}{-{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373202 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373203 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373202 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373204 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373202 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373205 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373202 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373206 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373202 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373207 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373202 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373202 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373202 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373206 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373202 1080 #uuid "e5193249-041d-5258-8bb5-af201644a8df" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373203 1081 "{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta " 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373203 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373203 1084 #uuid "daef00ec-f0af-55f1-a147-630d2fa39a6d" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373204 1081 "\\frac{1}{2}{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta " 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373204 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373204 1084 #uuid "bdba039a-b7e3-51de-b62c-a0a62757bb9a" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373205 1081 "{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta " 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373205 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373205 1084 #uuid "8bb2de73-e9a4-5123-8f86-f3a4b9582828" 13194139533450 175921