ical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nIn the given equation, we have $h=-3$ and $k=1,$ so the center is located at $(-3,1).$\n\nIn the given equation, we also have ${a}^{2}=2$ and ${b}^{2}=4.$\n\n- Since ${a}^{2}=2,$ the length of the horizontal radius must be $a=\\sqrt{2}.$\n\n- Since ${b}^{2}=4,$ the length of the vertical radius must be $b=\\sqrt{4}=2.$\n\nSo the semi-major axis has length $b=2,$ and the semi-minor axis has length $a=\\sqrt{2}.$\n\nTherefore, the major axis has length $2b=2\\cdot 2=4,$ and the minor axis has length $2a=2\\cdot \\sqrt{2}=2\\sqrt{2}.$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373216 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373217 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373216 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373218 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373216 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373219 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373216 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373220 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373216 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373221 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373216 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373216 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373216 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373220 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373216 1080 #uuid "7deabc1b-dd82-587e-9d2e-60fae832ca1c" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373217 1081 "$4$ and $\\sqrt{2}$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373217 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373217 1084 #uuid "f6b852d2-b859-5459-9dcd-ff38deedc628" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373218 1081 "$8$ and $2\\sqrt{2}$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373218 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373218 1084 #uuid "88aeea1c-750f-583a-a3e4-8c6f368dfc6b" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373219 1081 "$2$ and $\\sqrt{2}$" 13194