),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t+5)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\sqrt{6}t,\\,3{t}^{2},\\,1⟩ \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(-\\sqrt{6}t)}^{2}+{(3{t}^{2})}^{2}+{1}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6{t}^{2}+9{t}^{4}+1} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(1+3{t}^{2})^{2}} \\\\  & =1+3{t}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the arc length of the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & ={\\int }_{0}^{5}‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{5}(1+3{t}^{2})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =(t+{t}^{3}){|}_{0}^{5} \\\\  & =5+125-0 \\\\  & =130.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373237 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373238 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373237 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373239 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373237 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373240 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373237 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373241 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373237 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373242 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373237 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373237 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373237 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373238 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373237 1080 #uuid "f96bcd49-a02f-5bd7-ab21-7a05bacf2ad7" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373238 1081 "130" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373238 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373238 1084 #uuid "4ffcfd43-b15b-55e0-9453-963134a6d995" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373239 1081 "150" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373239 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373239 1084 #uuid "2e9391e4-7424-54d0-a36c-f5b21aa3b4e9" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373240 1081 "125" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373240 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373240 1084 #uuid "726ddffe-91b8-5f33-bfb8-b9930883abab" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373241 1081 "75" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373241 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373241 1084 #uuid "4048f826-7e00-5c3f-ad4e-3b51a78539bf" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373242 1081 "90" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373242 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373242 1084 #uuid "4ab3aac1-31a4-5103-a8fc-ee5e47c2090b" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373243 1068 #edb/ref 17592186373244 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373243 1069 "q-79838" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373243 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373243 1071 "Estimate $\\sqrt{3.9}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1.5)$ using a differential $\\text{d}f$ of the function $f(x,y)=\\sqrt{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y$ at the point $(4,\\frac{\\pi }{2}).$ Round your answer to $3$ decimal places." 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373243 1072 #uuid "ba7d8609-104d-5a2e-b355-39ac5dc83584" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373243 1074 "First, let's find the differential:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}f(x,y) & =(\\frac{∂f}{∂x})\\,\\text{d}x+(\\frac{∂f}{∂y})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡y}{2\\sqrt{x}}\\,\\text{d}x-\\sqrt{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the point $(4,\\frac{\\pi }{2}),$ the differential is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}f(x,y) & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})}{2\\sqrt{4}}\\,\\text{d}x-\\sqrt{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =0\\,\\text{d}x-2\\,\\text{d}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, if we move to the point $(4+Δx,\\frac{\\pi }{2}+Δy),$ then we can approximate the change in $f$ as\n\n$$\nΔf≈0\\,Δx-2\\,Δy\n$$\n\nNote that \n\n$$\n\\sqrt{3.9}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1.5)=f(3.9,1.5),\n$$\n\nso we want to move to the point $(3.9,1.5).$\n\nMoving from $(4,\\frac{\\pi }{2})$ to $(3.9,1.5),$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Δx & =3.9-4=-0.1, \\\\ Δy & =1.5-\\frac{\\pi }{2}≈-0.070796.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Δf & ≈0\\cdot (-0.1)-2(-0.070796) \\\\  & ≈0+0.141592 \\\\  & ≈0.141592.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis means that the value of $f$ increases by about $0.141592.$ Consequently, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(3.9,1.5) & ≈f(4,\\frac{\\pi }{2})+0.141592 \\\\ \\sqrt{3.9}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1.5) & ≈\\sqrt{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})+0.141592 \\\\  & ≈0+0.141592 \\\\  & ≈0.142,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to $3$ decimal places." 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373244 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373245 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373244 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373246 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373244 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373247 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373244 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373248 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373244 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373249 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373244 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373244 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373244 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373247 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373244 1080 #uuid "b0095e22-2029-58c2-ab81-2e1546884b41" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373245 1081 "0.138" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373245 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373245 1084 #uuid "5523408e-53c1-55c6-9d6c-93f6067c5024" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373246 1081 "0.146" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373246 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373246 1084 #uuid "3a0e8bda-987d-556d-adc4-5475e67e3649" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373247 1081 "0.142" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373247 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186