on of ${T}^{-1}(D)$ in the $uv$-plane." 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373304 1072 #uuid "604b3cfb-1122-5242-b2a0-d1ba7f8e69ef" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373304 1074 "First, notice that we are given that \n\n$$\n{T}^{-1}:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}x-y \\\\ y+1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x-y=u$ and $y=v-1$ into the equation of the first curve, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-y)^{2}+y=3\\,⟹\\,{u}^{2}+v-1=3\\,⟹\\,v=4-{u}^{2},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhile substituting $y=v-1$ into the equation of the second curve, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y=2\\,⟹\\,v-1=2\\,⟹\\,v=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the intersections of the curves in the $uv$-plane, we solve the following system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}v=4-{u}^{2} \\\\ v=3\\end{aligned}\\,⟹\\,{\\begin{aligned}u=\\pm 1 \\\\ v=3.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the intersection points are $(\\pm 1,3).$\n\n![](images/4d/4d719cc14094ad632069bcdb9307929bae3030072c1ce3d0f57f3ca682e0aac0.png)\n\nAs a result, our domain in the $uv$-plane has the type I representation \n\n$$\n{T}^{-1}(D)={(u,v)\\,:\\,-1\\le u\\le 1,\\,3\\le v\\le 4-{u}^{2}}.\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373305 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373306 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373305 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373307 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373305 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373308 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373305 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373309 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373305 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373310 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373305 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373305 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373305 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373310 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373305 1080 #uuid "84e0911f-09be-58c6-930f-c121a42a7e93" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373306 1081 "{(u,