7 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373359 1071 "Calculate the $y$-intercepts of the hyperbola $\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{9}=1.$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373359 1072 #uuid "c6a70575-ac5b-5e8c-8521-83fa0f483f95" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373359 1074 "To find the $y$-intercepts of the hyperbola, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation of the hyperbola and solve for $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{9} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{(0)^{2}}{9} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{4} & =1 \\\\ (y-1)^{2} & =4 \\\\ y-1 & =\\pm 2 \\\\ y & =-1,3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the $y$-intercepts are $(0,-1)$ and $(0,3).$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373360 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373361 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373360 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373362 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373360 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373363 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373360 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373364 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373360 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373365 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373360 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373360 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373360 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373363 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373360 1080 #uuid "15961f60-3be3-529d-b39f-fa950ec06d55" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373361 1081 "(0,\\pm 1)" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373361 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373361 1084 #uuid "f2d6476e-134a-5bbf-8b91-87b7881dab50" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373362 1081 "$(0,-3)$ and $(0,1)$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373362 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373362 1084 #uuid "081bb5a9-cc30-54b5-a52e-6a7a570df0a7" 13194139533450 1759218