 17592186045585 true] [17592186373413 1072 #uuid "2a8e25ab-7a84-57a7-9ca6-1cae41765965" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373413 1074 "To calculate the $y$-intercept, we need to substitute $x=0$ in the equation of the ellipse and solve the resulting equation for $y.$ Doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(0-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{4}{4}+\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ 1+\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ 16+(y-1)^{2} & =16 \\\\ (y-1)^{2} & =0 \\\\ y-1 & =0 \\\\ y & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the ellipse intercepts the $y$-axis at the point $(0,1).$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373414 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373415 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373414 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373416 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373414 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373417 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373414 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373418 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373414 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373419 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373414 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373414 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373414 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373415 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373414 1080 #uuid "b5ce2e8e-e6fe-5614-8843-3f6dce80d1ce" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373415 1081 "(0,1)" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373415 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373415 1084 #uuid "36279fed-98b2-56c6-969d-5b3c6989ffcf" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373416 1081 "(0,-1)" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373416 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373416 1084 #uuid "99f8646d-0077-54fd-94bc-eeca4bce14ff" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373417 1081 "(0,2)" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373417 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373417 1084 #uuid "e9b2b0e0-c3b7-53c7-bcb5-853a47daebd0" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373418 1081 "(0,3)" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373418 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373418 1084 #uuid "924f8854-9c5f-5228-a7d9-b35c5131ddc0" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373419 1081 "(0,-2)" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373419 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373419 1084 #uuid "445306c4-723e-5013-b80b-f77655b8eb66" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373420 1068 #edb/ref 17592186373421 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373420 1069 "q-9473" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373420 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373420 1071 "Determine the points where the ellipse ${x}^{2}+4{y}^{2}+2x+24y+21=0$ intercepts the $y$-axis." 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373420 1072 #uuid "9825f0c0-4cbf-5b05-b433-626d51c84d0e" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373420 1074 "To calculate the $y$-intercepts, we need to substitute $x=0$ in the equation of the ellipse and try to solve the resulting equation for $y.$ We do this and solve the resulting equation by completing the square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+4{y}^{2}+2x+24y+21 & =0 \\\\ {0}^{2}+4{y}^{2}+2\\cdot 0+24y+21 & =0 \\\\ 4{y}^{2}+24y+21 & =0 \\\\ 4[{y}^{2}+6y]+21 & =0 \\\\ 4[(y+3)^{2}-9]+21 & =0 \\\\ 4(y+3)^{2}-36+21 & =0 \\\\ 4(y+3)^{2}-15 & =0 \\\\ 4(y+3)^{2} & =15 \\\\ (y+3)^{2} & =\\frac{15}{4} \\\\ y+3 & =\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{2} \\\\ y & =-3\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the ellipse intercepts the $y$-axis at $(0,-3-\\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{2})$ and $(0,-3+\\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{2}).$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373421 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373422 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373421 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373423 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373421 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373424 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373421 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373425 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373421 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373426 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373421 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373421 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373421 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373423 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373421 1080 #uuid "11f67345-9bcd-580f-9a78-f2110d0af887" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373422 1081 "(0,-1\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{4})" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373422 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373422 1084 #uuid "93c9bc7d-bc0b-5f59-89d9-947d2beb4544" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373423 1081 "(0,-3\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{2})" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373423 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373423 1084 #uuid "8e36c2fa-df15-50ff-a0c6-0defdf46e634" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373424 1081 "(0,1\\pm \\sqrt{15})" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373424 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373424 1084 #uuid "d9c89afc-44e7-5be7-bc36-94046b855048" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373425 1081 "(0,2\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2})" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373425 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373425 1084 #uuid "da372f50-a560-5fe9-b333-bf317febd0bd" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373426 1081 "(0,-3\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3})" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373426 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373426 1084 #uuid "3e451eae-29dc-5609-aea0-e91b6a1f1864" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373427 1068 #edb/ref 17592186373428 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373427 1069 "q-97772" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373427 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373427 1071 "The velocity $v,$ in meters per second, of a particle $P$ at time $t$ is given by $v(t)=⟨-{t}^{2},\\,1,\\,t⟩.$ Find the normal component of the acceleration of $P$ at time $t=1\\,\\text{s}.$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373427 1072 #uuid "638a08f9-c870-567e-8a08-74eea5cd4229" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373427 1074 "The normal component of acceleration is given by\n\n$$\n{a}_{N}=\\frac{||v\\times a||}{||v||}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we evaluate $v(1):$\n\n$$\nv(1)=⟨-1,\\,1,\\,1⟩\n$$\n\nNext, we compute the acceleration vector by differentiating the velocity vector and evaluating it at $t=1,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-{t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2t,\\,0,\\,1⟩, \\\\ a(1) & =⟨-2,\\,0,\\,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we compute $v(1)\\times a(1),||v(1)||,$ and $||v(1)\\times a(1)||:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(1)\\times a(1) & =⟨-1,\\,1,\\,1⟩\\times ⟨-2,\\,0,\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,i-\\left|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,j+\\left|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,k \\\\  & =⟨1,-1,2⟩, \\\\ ||v(1)|| & =\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{1}^{2}+{1}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3}, \\\\ ||v(1)\\times a(1)|| & =\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{2}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the normal component of the acceleration at $t=1,$ and we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{N} & =\\frac{||v(1)\\times a(1)||}{||v(1)||} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{\\sqrt{3}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the normal component of acceleration is $\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}.$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373428 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373429 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373428 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373430 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373428 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373431 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373428 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373432 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373428 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373433 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373428 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373428 1077 "selection" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373428 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373431 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373428 1080 #uuid "7091664e-2754-55cb-8e6b-805bbde4d738" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373429 1081 "2\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373429 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373429 1084 #uuid "eb197ec9-57f4-530e-9b9c-f424c0d978d1" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373430 1081 "\\sqrt{3}\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373430 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373430 1084 #uuid "6f870456-a465-5019-9cf3-96e295eaacfb" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373431 1081 "\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373431 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373431 1084 #uuid "013a46e0-cf4c-5311-8f77-cd2ae8ad1c8e" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373432 1081 "3\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373432 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373432 1084 #uuid "b0c64d01-3b75-5743-b1c1-c8a697b0ac2c" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373433 1081 "3\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373433 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373433 1084 #uuid "1bdcfa05-bfe7-5514-856d-11faaa47af65" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373434 1068 #edb/ref 17592186373435 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373434 1069 "q-99409" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373434 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373434 1071 "Find the binormal vector to the curve $r(t)$ at an arbitrary point, given that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(t) & =⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t,0,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t⟩, \\\\ N(t) & =⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t,0,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that $T$ and $N$ denote the unit tangent and principal normal, respectively." 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373434 1072 #uuid "a933436d-0584-5de5-aa04-efee8c77b6c2" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373434 1074 "The binormal vector is given by\n\n$$\nB(t)=T(t)\\times N(t).\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B(t) & =T(t)\\times N(t) \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t,0,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t⟩\\times ⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t,0,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t⟩ \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡3t & 0 & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t & 0 & -\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =[\\text{ }\\left|\\begin{aligned}0 & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t \\\\ 0 & -\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,i-\\left|\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t & -\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,j+\\left|\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t & 0 \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t & 0\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,k\\text{ }] \\\\  & =⟨0-0,-(-{cos}^{2}⁡3t-{sin}^{2}⁡3t),0-0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,1,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533450 17592186045585 true] [17592186373435 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373436 13194139533450 175921860